--------------------------------------------
TABLE_NAME                                TABLE_TYPE  HIDDEN  
------------------------------------------------------------------
TBS_NAME                                  
--------------------------------------------
SYS                                       
$GIT_PK_T1                                T  G  
SYS_TBS_DISK_DATA                         
1 row selected.

