$T0> create unique index idx1 on t1 (i1,i2);
[ERR-31051 : Duplicate key columns in an index]
$T0> create unique index idx1 on t1 (i1);
Create success.
$T0> create unique index idx1 on t1 (i2);
[ERR-3104C : Duplicate index name]

